# Workspace-level ignores

# Node dependencies
**/node_modules/

# Expo local state
.expo/
apps/mobile/.expo/
apps/mobile/dist/
apps/mobile/web-build/

# Local environment files
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/.env*.local

# Credentials — NEVER commit these.
# google-services.json is deliberately NOT ignored: it carries the public
# Firebase client config, which is designed to ship inside the app bundle and
# is not a secret. An Admin SDK key is the opposite and must stay out.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
**/serviceAccount*.json
**/service-account*.json
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.keystore
**/*.jks

# Build artifacts
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.apk
**/*.aab

# Local logs and emulator output. These can contain project ids, document
# paths and user ids from real test data, so they must not be committed.
*.log
**/*.log
firebase-debug.log*
firestore-debug.log*
ui-debug.log*
database-debug.log*
pubsub-debug.log*

# Scoped typecheck aids created during verification passes
**/tsconfig.*.tmp.json

# Working notes: audits, design specs and phase reports produced while
# refactoring. Listed by name rather than a *.md glob so README.md and
# anything under docs/ stay tracked.
/AUDIT_FIREBASE_COACH.md
/AUDIT_RN_PERF.md
/COACHING_LOOP_DESIGN.md
/COACHING_SCENARIOS.md
/DAILY_REPORT_FINAL_DESIGN.md
/DAILY_REPORT_STEP1_CORRECTED.md
/DAILY_REPORT_STEP1_DISCOVERY.md
/DESIGN_SYSTEM_REFACTOR.md
/FYTRAK_ANALYSIS.md
/ONBOARDING_WORKOUT_VERIFICATION.md
/PRODUCTION_AUDIT.md
/V0_RUNTIME_ARCHITECTURE.md
/FYTRAK_DEFERRED_BACKEND_WORK.md
/FYTRAK_DESIGN_CODE_AUDIT.md

# Local design handoff exports and visual references
/Fytrak design 1/
/Fytrak design hh.zip
/splash.mp4

# Local design/source archives — never publish these
*.zip

# Local tool caches
**/.fdc-cache.json

# Demo assets: keep the short cut in the repo, keep the heavy originals out
demo/stills/
demo/fytrak-demo-full-vertical.mp4
